UPDATE companies SET description='Great Sky Solar was founded in 2026 and is headquartered in Lexington, Massachusetts.

The firm designs and installs custom solar arrays and electric heat pumps using in-house crews rather than subcontractors. Its process includes a custom design phase, a good-faith agreement with zero deposit, a dedicated project manager, expert installation, and ongoing lifetime system support. To date the team of 10-plus local experts has completed more than 2,980 installations representing over 30 megawatts of installed capacity.

The company references hundreds of neighbors who have switched to solar and highlights installations on both homes and businesses.

The company positions itself as a departure from volume-driven sales models, emphasizing transparent guidance, no-commission advisors, and a 30-year insurance-backed warranty that covers failures, labor costs, and even insolvency risk. Its stated mission is to align clean energy with clean business practices, prioritizing long-term accountability over short-term growth.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system custom design", "Solar panel installation", "Heat pump installation", "Energy monitoring and control", "Project management", "Lifetime system support", "Good-faith agreement with zero deposit"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Renewable energy", "Energy efficiency"], "materials": ["Tier 1 solar panels", "Electric heat pumps"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house installation teams with no subcontractors", "Zero deposit required at signing", "Lifetime system support backed by a 30-year insurance-backed warranty", "Transparent guidance with no sales commissions or pressure tactics", "Over 30 MW of solar capacity installed across 2,980+ systems"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2026 -> / (homepage) and /about", "Headquarters 3 Bow St, Lexington, MA 02420 -> / (homepage) and /about", "10+ local experts on team -> / (homepage) and /about", "2,980+ solar systems installed -> / (homepage) and /about", "30 MW installed capacity -> /about", "In-house teams, no subcontractors -> /about", "Zero deposit, dedicated project manager, lifetime support -> / (homepage) and /about", "30-year insurance-backed warranty -> /about", "Residential and commercial customers (home or business) -> / (homepage)", "Tier 1 panels, heat pumps -> / (homepage)"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We design and install solar systems built to last, with honest guidance, skilled craftsmanship, and genuine care for every home.", "founded_yea