UPDATE companies SET description='Green Hills Metal Werks operates from Dousman, Wisconsin. The business took shape when owner Jake, who had been welding since purchasing his first welder at 14, acquired a CNC plasma table and began turning his fabrication experience into a commercial venture.

The shop produces commercial and residential signage, garden art sculptures, custom metal fabrications, and short-run production parts. Core processes include CNC plasma cutting, welding, and hand-finishing, with capabilities spanning structural and ornamental metalwork, handrails, backlit signs, water features, and decorative wall art. The company serves customers across Southeast Wisconsin, including Oconomowoc, Waukesha, Milwaukee, and Madison.

Clients range from businesses needing monument, projecting, or wall-mounted signs to homeowners commissioning personal/family signs, ranch and farm markers, garden fountains, and memorial pieces. The portfolio also includes interior and exterior decor for cabins and lodges.

Jake emphasizes a design-to-finish approach, offering custom designs crafted by hand and maintaining licensed, bonded, and insured status. The operation was built on the idea of helping customers bring their ideas to reality through artistic metalwork.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC plasma cutting", "Custom metal fabrication", "Welding", "Metal art sculpture", "Sign fabrication (commercial, personal, monument, projecting, wall-mounted)", "Short-run production", "Structural/ornamental metalwork", "Handrail and railing fabrication", "Backlit sign fabrication", "Water feature fabrication", "Custom design services"], "industries": ["Commercial signage", "Residential metal art and decor", "Garden and landscape sculpture", "Agricultural/ranch signage", "Memorials"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CNC plasma table"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed, bonded, and insured", "Custom designs crafted by hand", "CNC plasma cutting for custom fabrication", "Serves Southeast Wisconsin (Oconomowoc, Waukesha, Milwaukee, Madison)", "Design-to-finish service for signs and sculpture"], "facts_used": ["Owner Jake purchased first welder at age 14 -> /about-us", "Business began with purchase of CNC plasma table -> /about-us", "Located in Dousman, Wisconsin -> db", "Services include commercial signs, garden art, custom fabrication, short run production -> /", "Serves Oconomowoc, Waukesha, Milwaukee, Madison -> /", "Licensed, bonded, and insured -> /", "Offers CNC plasma cutting -> /", "Custom designs crafted by hand -> /", "Provides design-to-finish service for signs and sculpture -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Metal art sculptures made locally to dress up your yard and make your neighbors jealous.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}