UPDATE companies SET description='Grimm Metal Fabricators, Inc. operates from Lombard, Illinois, where it runs a full-service fabricating and welding facility across two adjacent buildings totaling 42,000 square feet. The company describes itself as a job shop capable of handling projects ranging from small parts to large weldments.

