UPDATE companies SET description='H.W. Woodwork is a second-generation millwork company based in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. The business was founded by Hans Werner, who began by providing millwork for residential customers. Ownership remains in the family, though the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed.

