UPDATE companies SET description='HONYA Lighting is headquartered in Plainview, New York, on Long Island, with a second operations site in Stafford, Texas. The company was established as a professional LED lighting sales and distribution center serving the New York metropolitan area, the tri-state region, and the broader North American market.

The firm manufactures and wholesales a range of LED commercial and industrial lighting products, including flood lights, area lights, exit signs, T8 tubes, vanity linear lights, surface-mount downlights with motion sensors and emergency backup, and tandem strip fixtures. Its combined inventory facilities total approximately 80,000 square feet, with over 20,000 square feet at the Plainview location. Headcount and annual production volumes are not disclosed.

HONYA serves residential, commercial, and industrial customers across the United States. Its products are specified for projects in the New York tri-state area and are distributed nationally through wholesale channels.

