UPDATE companies SET description='Health Korea Hawaii operates from Honolulu, Hawaii, where it runs an online and retail operation specializing in Korean massage chairs and health foods. The company, doing business as Health Korea Shop, offers a curated selection of wellness products sourced from Korean brands such as H Solution and Chunho N Care. No founding year or ownership details are publicly disclosed.

