UPDATE companies SET description='Hewtech Electronics LLC operates from China Township, Michigan.

The firm designs and manufactures electronic circuits, instruments, and control products, with a specialty in precision fuel quantity indication (FQI) modules for liquefied natural gas (LNG) level monitoring using capacitance probes. Its product line includes rotational speed monitoring alarms, tank switchers, LNG fueling station liquid/vapor detectors, and a series of cryogenic liquid nitrogen level alarms and controllers. Hewtech also provides end‑to‑end engineering support, electronic and PCB design (surface‑mount and through‑hole), prototype fabrication, design‑validation and process‑validation testing, and full‑scale production. The company handles certification to UL, FM, CSA, and CE standards and conducts EMC testing.

Hewtech serves original equipment manufacturers in industrial process control, aeronautics, medical, automotive, motorsports, biological freezing, cold storage, and alternative‑fuel vehicle (LNG) markets. Customers range from companies seeking private‑label products to those needing custom sensor and control solutions for cryogenic and high‑reliability applications.

The company emphasizes flexibility in adapting its technology without the high engineering costs typical of custom development, citing 40 years of experience in cryogenic liquid monitoring. It also offers its entire product portfolio and underlying intellectual property for acquisition, positioning itself as a source of ready‑to‑manufacture designs for organizations looking to expand their offerings quickly.', certifications=ARRAY['UL','FM','CSA','CE']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom electronic product design (OEM private-label)", "Engineering support and consulting", "Analog and digital electronic design (DC to microwave)", "EMC compliance design", "PCB design and layout (SMT and through-hole)", "Gerber file generation", "Schematic capture and CAD assembly drawings", "Bill of materials (BOM) creation", "Prototype manufacturing", "Design Validation (DV) and Process Validation (PV) testing", "Full-scale production manufacturing", "Product certification (UL, FM, CSA, CE)", "EMC testing", "Capacitance probe level sensing", "Cryogenic liquid level monitoring (LN2, LNG)", "Rotational speed monitoring", "Tank switching control", "Liquid/vapor detection"], "industries": ["Industrial process control", "Aeronautics", "Medical", "Automotive", "Motorsports", "Biological freezing systems", "Cold storage", "Alternative fuel vehicles (LNG)", "OEM"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["40 years of experience in cryogenic and LNG level monitoring systems", "Custom product design with reduced engineering overhead", "Full-cycle development from concept through certified production", "Intellectual property and technology portfolio available for acquisition", "Expertise in analog/digital circuit design up to microwave frequencies with EMC compliance focus"], "facts_used": ["Company name and location -> db", "Specializes in FQI modules for LNG using capacitance probes -> db", "Product list: rotational speed alarm, 