UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Fargo, North Dakota, the office operates as an authorized Hobart service partner under Jeffrey D. Doyle, Inc., providing factory-authorized repair and maintenance for commercial kitchen equipment. The location also maintains a parts counter with 40,000 stocked SKUs for immediate purchase.

