UPDATE companies SET description='Hoboken Custom Craft operates from a workshop in Hoboken, New Jersey. The company was founded by Anton David, managing partner of Avid Handyman and Construction, a locally owned and operated handyman and construction firm serving Hoboken, Jersey City, and surrounding areas. David established HCC as a sister company to provide clients with unique residential and commercial furnishings, assembling a team of designers, carpenters, and finishers.

The shop functions as a full-service woodworking operation, handling planning, design, fabrication, and installation. Its output ranges from simple storage solutions and full closet build-outs to heirloom-quality furniture pieces. Work is carried out in the company''s Hoboken workshop by the in-house team of designers, carpenters, and finishers.

