UPDATE companies SET description='Home Reserve operates from Fort Wayne, Indiana, where it has been an American-owned and operated business for 25 years. The company manufactures modular sectionals and seating entirely in its Indiana facility, shipping orders within one week. No founders are named in the available materials.

The product line centers on configurable sectionals—deep-seat, standard, loveseat, chair, and ottoman models—built with sustainably sourced wood frames, CertiPUR-US® certified foam, and PFAS-free, machine-washable performance fabrics. Every component, from covers and cushions to frame parts, is designed to be individually replaceable, a feature the company calls Part-by-Part Renewability. To date, Home Reserve reports over one million units sold to more than 200,000 customers, with free shipping on all orders.

Reviews highlight families with young children and pets—one noting survival of “multiple spills within the first week” with two dogs and a toddler—and apartment dwellers who appreciate the easy-carry boxes that navigate tight stairways. The furniture has been featured on HGTV, Apartment Therapy, A&E, Better Homes & Gardens, and Dwell.

Home Reserve positions itself on longevity and low-waste ownership: a 10-year frame and hardware warranty, a 60-day no-risk trial, and $1 fabric swatches let buyers test materials before committing. The made-in-USA construction, stain-resistant fabrics, and built-in storage compartments are presented as the core reasons customers choose the brand over disposable alternatives.', certifications=ARRAY['CertiPUR-US®']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Modular furniture manufacturing", "Wood framing", "Foam cushioning (CertiPUR-US certified)", "Upholstery with PFAS-free fabrics", "Machine washable, stain-resistant fabric application", "Custom configuration and changeable layouts", "Direct-to-consumer fulfillment", "Part-by-part replacement program"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home furnishings", "Direct-to-consumer home goods"], "materials": ["Sustainably sourced wood", "CertiPUR-US\u00ae certified foam", "PFAS-free fabrics", "Machine washable, stain-resistant performance fabrics"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Over 1 million units sold to date", "lead_time": "Ships in 1 week (Priority Fulfillment Available)", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Replaceable covers, cushions, and frame parts (Part-by-Part Renewability)", "Machine washable, stain-resistant performance fabrics", "Built-in storage in every sectional", "10-year frame and hardware warranty", "Ships in 1 week from Indiana with free shipping"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Fort Wayne, Indiana -> db", "25 Years American Owned & Operated -> /", "Manufactures modular sectionals, sofas, loveseats, chairs, ottomans in Indiana -> /", "Uses sustainably sourced wood, CertiPUR-US\u00ae certified foam, PFAS-free fabrics -> /", "Part-by-Part Renewability: replaceable covers, cushions, frame parts -> /", "Over 1 million units sold, 200,000+ customers -> /", "Ships in 1 week from Indiana, free shipping -> /", "10-year frame and hardware warranty -> /", "60-day no-risk trial, $1 fabric swatches -> /", "Machine wa