UPDATE companies SET description='Home Team Energy Company is a residential solar installer based in Brookfield, Wisconsin, serving the Milwaukee and Madison areas. Founded in 2019 by Ryan Lettau, a Milwaukee School of Engineering graduate with a decade of solar industry experience, the company began as a family operation run from a garage. Lettau''s wife, Shelly, managed permitting and logistics while their young sons assisted with site cleanup, establishing a deliberately small, family-owned structure that remains central to the business.

The firm provides turnkey solar energy systems for homeowners across Southern Wisconsin, handling design, permitting, and installation with its own in-house crews rather than subcontractors. Services include rooftop solar arrays, battery storage, and EV charger installation. Since launch, the team has completed more than 700 residential projects comprising over 13,000 installed panels, with typical installations ranging from two days to four weeks from contract signing to commissioning.

Lettau started the company after watching rapid growth at a previous solar employer erode customer service. He designed Home Team Energy to stay "intentionally small" so that quality and direct communication never give way to volume. The firm emphasizes transparent pricing, honest advice on battery ROI, and full project management from permit to permission-to-operate.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential solar panel installation", "Battery energy storage installation", "EV charging station installation", "Solar system design", "Permitting and regulatory compliance", "Project management", "Net metering coordination"], "industries": ["Residential solar energy", "Renewable energy installation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house installation crews with no subcontractors", "Founder personally meets with every client", "Full in-house design, permitting, and installation", "Transparent pricing with no upselling on battery storage", "Family-owned and operated from Brookfield, WI"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2019 by Ryan Lettau -> /about-us", "Ryan Lettau graduated MSOE 2008 with Architectural Engineering degree -> /about-us", "Worked for roof consulting company then solar development company 2010 -> /about-us", "Started Home Team Energy in 2019 with garage full of solar panels -> /about-us", "Wife Shelly handled permitting and logistics, sons helped with cleanup -> /about-us", "Family-owned business -> /about-us", "750+ residential installs -> /about-us", "13,000+ solar panels across 700+ residential installations -> /about-us", "Based in Brookfield, serve Southern Wisconsin -> /about-us", "In-house installation crews -> /about-us", "Handle design, permitting, installation in-house -> /about-us", "Intentionally small, founder personally meets clients -> /about-us", "Services: Solar Panels, Energy Storage, EV Charging -> /", "Locally owned and operated -> /", "Installation in 2 days to 4 weeks from reviews -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We specialize in residential solar installations across Southern Wisconsin, and we handle everything in-house \u2014 from design to permitting to installation \u2014 using our own skilled solar crew.", "founded_year": "2019", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned", "Small business"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='home-team-energy-company' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
