UPDATE companies SET description='Horizon Equipment is based in Eagan, Minnesota, and serves the commercial foodservice industry with a focus on custom kitchen solutions. The company designs, equips, installs, and maintains commercial kitchens for a range of clients, from independent restaurants to large-scale commissary bakeries.

