UPDATE companies SET description='HornBlasters, Inc. is based in Tampa, Florida, and was founded in 2002 by owner Matt Heller. The idea originated during Heller''s daily commute when he grew frustrated with being overlooked by other drivers. Drawing on a lifelong fascination with locomotive air horns, he began adapting that massive sound for everyday vehicles, initially operating out of his bedroom and selling kits from the back of his pickup truck before leaving his day job to grow the business full-time.

