UPDATE companies SET description='Horst Sheet Metal Inc operates from New Holland, Pennsylvania, in Lancaster County. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure in its public materials, and no founders are named on its website.

It produces kitchen accents such as stainless cabinet doors, copper sinks, backsplashes, range hoods, and countertops; roofing components including architectural moldings, ES-1 edgings, gutters, and downspouts; and HVAC parts like ductwork, fittings, adapters, wall caps, and piping. The facility also replicates historical moldings and finials for restoration projects. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

Customers include homeowners, contractors, kitchen manufacturers, designers, and architects.

