UPDATE companies SET description='Hyundai Mobis Alabama, LLC was established in 2002 on nearly 83 acres in Montgomery, Alabama. The company operates as a subsidiary of Hyundai MOBIS, the parts and service arm for South Korean automakers Hyundai Motor Company, Genesis Motors, and Kia Motors. It was created to serve as the largest Tier 1 supplier to Hyundai Motor Manufacturing Alabama (HMMA) and Kia Motor Manufacturing Georgia (KMMG).

The facility spans a 600,000-square-foot plastics plant where injection molding produces front and rear bumpers, instrument panel frames, and after-service parts. Bumpers are molded and painted in-house. A neighboring module plant assembles cockpit (dashboard) modules and front and rear chassis modules using parts from Tier 2 and 3 suppliers. The site also houses a Redistribution Center that ships genuine Hyundai and Kia service parts to dealerships, auto parts stores, and distribution centers across North America.

Its Redistribution Center supports the aftermarket by supplying parts to dealerships and retailers nationwide. Customers include the two vehicle assembly plants and the broader North American dealer network.

Hyundai Mobis Alabama emphasizes just-in-sequence delivery, in-house molding and painting, and modular system integration to reduce vehicle weight, part count, and assembly complexity. The operation holds ISO 14001 and IATF 16949 certifications and follows the Hyundai Motor Group''s core values of customer focus, challenge, collaboration, people, and globality.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 14001','IATF 16949']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding", "Plastic painting", "Cockpit module assembly", "Chassis module assembly", "Bumper assembly", "After-service parts redistribution", "Just-in-sequence (JIS) logistics", "Research and development of auto parts", "System integration of modularization"], "industries": ["Automotive (OEM)", "Automotive aftermarket"], "materials": ["Plastics (injection molded)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Largest Tier 1 supplier to HMMA and KMMG", "Just-in-sequence (JIS) module delivery", "In-house injection molding, painting, and assembly", "ISO 14001 and IATF 16949 certified", "North American redistribution of genuine Hyundai/Kia service parts"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2002 in Montgomery, Alabama -> /about-us", "Largest Tier 1 supplier to HMMA and KMMG -> /about-us", "83-acre site with 600,000 sq ft plastics plant -> /about-us", "Injection molding, painting, and assembly of bumpers, instrument panels, cockpit and chassis modules -> /about-us", "Redistribution Center for genuine Hyundai/Kia service parts across North America -> /about-us", "ISO 14001 and IATF 16949 certifications -> /about-us", "Just-in-sequence (JIS) module supply -> /about-us", "Part of Hyundai MOBIS (South Korea) -> /about-us", "Core values: Customer, Challenge, Collaboration, People, Globality -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "MOBIS Alabama, LLC is the largest Tier 1 supplier to Hyundai Motor Manufacturing Alabama and Kia Motor Manufacturing Georgi